hand each card they exiled this way.', '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Defiler: Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice a Forest: Add three mana in any combination of {R} and/or {G}.', '{T}: Add {B}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{4}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Keldon Necropolis deals 2 damage to any target.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{G}, {T}: Regenerate target creature.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Strip Mine: Destroy target land.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you have exactly seven cards in hand.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Ancient Tomb deals 2 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast artifact spells.', '{T}: Add {G} for each Forest you control.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {G}{G}{G}.\nForestcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Forest card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{T}: Add {R}.', '{T}: Add {U} for each artifact you control.', '{T}: Add {U}.', '{T}: Add {W}.', '{T}: Draw two cards, then discard three cards.', '{T}: You may put a green creature card from your hand onto the battlefield. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', "{U}, {T}, Discard a card: Return target creature to its owner's hand.", '{U}: Killer Whale gains flying until end of turn.', "{U}: Untap Morphling.\n{U}: Morphling gains flying until end of turn.\n{U}: Morphling gains shroud until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\n{1}: Morphling gets +1/-1 until end of turn.\n{1}: Morphling gets -1/+1 until end of turn.", '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{W}: Soltari Emissary gains shadow until end of turn. (It can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)']
